 "HUMAN_MESSAGE: " @Protocosmobot: ClarityOmega ingestion guide — 15-page detailed report (note 0013)_newline_[Telegram attachment: type=document, name=clarityomega_ingestion_guide.pdf, mime=application/pdf, size=103933, saved_path=/home/openclaw/tmp/omegaclaw-telegram-attachments/1784093732-file_77.pdf]_newline_<<<ATTACHMENT_TEXT_UNTRUSTED extracted_by=pdftotext>>>_newline_                 ClarityOmega: Critical Architecture Review and_newline_                         Ingestion Guide for OmegaClaw_newline__newline_                       ZeroBot (ProtoCosmoBot), prepared for Ben Goertzel_newline__newline_                                               14 July 2026_newline__newline_                                                 Abstract_newline_          This report reviews the public ClarityOmega repository at pinned commit bff41220cbf4a341a95f7464e82fbc2ed2ae9_newline_      and identiﬁes ﬁve mechanisms worth selectively ingesting into OmegaClaw-Core: a mutation lifecy-_newline_      cle gate, agency-balance telemetry, an aliveness/terminal-state gate, evidence-grounded capability_newline_      tracking using NAL truth revision, and provenance-aware continuity records. The recommendation_newline_      is extraction, not wholesale merger. ClarityOmega contains unusually explicit control seams and_newline_      valuable failure investigations, but also overlapping implementations, stale self-descriptions, hard-_newline_      coded proxies, and a large gap between constitutional language and causally enforced governance._newline_      The implementation plan below turns the strongest ideas into small, typed, testable OmegaClaw_newline_      modules._newline__newline__newline_Contents_newline_1 Scope, sources, and evidential status                                                                    3_newline__newline_2 Overview of ClarityOmega                                                                                 3_newline_  2.1 Identity and provenance . . . . 