 "HUMAN_MESSAGE: " @bengoertzel: Can you make a revised pdf  ingestion spec for Clarity, reflecting the above observations and tweaks (less and more principled use of python, switch from nace to pln) 
 ((send "I’ll revise Clarity’s PDF ingestion spec to incorporate the observations, use Python more sparingly and systematically, and replace NACE with PLN.") (continue-thinking "preparing fuller response")) 
